hmsu←fromTime micros;total;hour;min;sec;u;rem
⍝ Convert duckdb_time micros -> (hour min sec micros)
⍝ Avoid ABI-sensitive struct return handling.

total←⌊micros
:If total<0
    hmsu←0 0 0 0
    →0
:EndIf
hour←⌊total÷3600000000
rem←total-hour×3600000000
min←⌊rem÷60000000
rem-←min×60000000
sec←⌊rem÷1000000
u←rem-sec×1000000
hmsu←hour min sec u
